comments.text:
Built and verified.

- **Data:** scripts/hero-data.py bakes web/src/ui/flow/hero-data.json (12 KB) from examples/chop-shop.apr's compiled timeline plus the Thunderer drum and horn stems. The drum loop is 4 beats, so it makes 8 half-beat chops (not the 16 in the plan). Horns: 4 chops, transposed −5 / 0 / +2 under I7 / IV7 / V7. The drum stems have no hit markers in the window, so transients are detected from the audio instead (like Live's transient markers).
- **Renderer:** web/src/ui/flow/{model,tween,layout,paint,story}.ts. Per-lane heights: pitched lanes are taller so transposition shows as height. Headers sit on the right, Live-style. Ribbons for lineage.
- **Decisions:**
  - The mobile composition shows all 8 bars, not 4, because the horns only play in bars 5–8.
  - Under reduced motion, the chapter buttons pick that chapter's settled frame.
- **Verified:**
  - chapters in light and dark;
  - mobile 375px with no horizontal scroll;
  - the reduced-motion still frame;
  - Hear "Chop Shop" opens the Score tab and plays;
  - a frame costs under 1 ms at 1080×380 @2x;
  - tsc and vite build pass;
  - web/test/flow.test.ts passes 3/3 (npm run test:flow).
